cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or reference the patent in academic work, please cite both this software and the patent application."
title: "H-LIF Neuron Family — FPGA & CUDA Reference Implementation"
abstract: >
  Patent-scoped reference implementation for TÜRKPATENT application 2026/007632.
  Contains 17 hazard-function-based spiking neuron models (TH-LIF, BH-LIF, their
  liquid extensions, physics-inspired and architecture-inspired variants), a
  custom fused CUDA kernel for TH-LIF with analytic natural gradient, and
  post-route FPGA measurements on a Digilent Arty A7-35T board.
type: software
authors:
